2026-10-28T17:23:15.3020477Z {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018BgYwYdhkbpeREk7LtC94E","type":"tool_result","content":"{\n  \"issue\": {\n    \"number\": 12,\n    \"title\": \"Support SES S/MIME signing with ACM certificates (`AssociateEmailIdentityCertificate` / `MessageSecurityOptions`)\",\n    \"author_association\": \"NONE\",\n    \"labels_at_open\": []\n  },\n  \"as_of\": \"2026-09-07T14:59:50+00:00\",\n  \"form\": {\n    \"template\": \"Request Net New Functionality\",\n    \"missing_required\": [],\n    \"empty_optional\": [],\n    \"used_form\": true\n  },\n  \"services\": {\n    \"resources_mentioned\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"aws_sesv2_email_identity_certificate\",\n        \"resource_exists\": false,\n        \"data_source_exists\": false,\n        \"service_label\": \"service/sesv2\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"aws_sesv2_email_identity\",\n        \"resource_exists\": true,\n        \"data_source_exists\": true,\n        \"service_label\": \"service/sesv2\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"aws_sesv2_configuration_set\",\n        \"resource_exists\": true,\n        \"data_source_exists\": true,\n        \"service_label\": \"service/sesv2\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"aws_acm_certificate\",\n        \"resource_exists\": true,\n        \"data_source_exists\": true,\n        \"service_label\": \"service/acm\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"regex_labeler_would_apply\": [\n      \"service/sesv2\"\n    ],\n    \"primary_service_label\": \"service/sesv2\"\n  },\n  \"versions\": {\n    \"terraform\": null,\n    \"provider\": null,\n    \"latest_release\": \"6.63.0\",\n    \"latest_release_date\": \"2026-09-03\",\n    \"provider_status\": \"not_reported\",\n    \"newer_release_notes\": [],\n    \"newer_fixes\": []\n  },\n  \"similar_issues\": [\n    {\n      \"number\": 31408,\n      \"ref\": \"hashicorp/terraform-provider-aws#31408\",\n      \"title\": \"[New Resource]: SESv2 Identity to Default Configuration Set association\",\n      \"body_excerpt\": \"Allow attaching default Configuration Set to already existing SES Identity. **I am aware that aws_sesv2_email_identity already exists** and allows specifying Default Configuration Sets, but: 1. I'd like to use this new resource with SES Identities provisioned with SESv1 API (which should be possible) without migrating them to SESv2. 2. There's API to provision this separately, which - by conventio\",\n      \"state\": \"open\",\n      \"state_reason\": null,\n      \"created_at\": \"2023-05-15T13:21:24Z\",\n      \"score\": 0.212,\n      \"band\": \"weak\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"number\": 43084,\n      \"ref\": \"hashicorp/terraform-provider-aws#43084\",\n      \"title\": \"ACM exportable public certificates\",\n      \"body_excerpt\": \"> AWS Certificate Manager introduces public certificates you can use anywhere * [Announcement]( * [Blog post]( Requires AWS SDK for Go v2 [Release 2025-06-17]( * aws_acm_certificate\",\n      \"state\": \"closed\",\n      \"state_reason\": \"completed\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2025-06-18T19:18:16Z\",\n      \"score\": 0.203,\n      \"band\": \"weak\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"number\": 48727,\n      \"ref\": \"hashicorp/terraform-provider-aws#48727\",\n      \"title\": \"ACME support in AWS Certificate Manager\",\n      \"body_excerpt\": \"> Today we\\u2019re announcing ACME support for public certificates in [AWS Certificate Manager (ACM)]( * [Announcement]( * [Blog post]( Requires AWS SDK for Go v2 [Release 2026-06-30](\",\n      \"state\": \"open\",\n      \"state_reason\": null,\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-07-01T16:13:19Z\",\n      \"score\": 0.177,\n      \"band\": \"weak\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"number\": 46671,\n      \"ref\": \"hashicorp/terraform-provider-aws#46671\",\n      \"title\": \"Support for SES `Email feedback forwarding` configuration for Domain Identity\",\n      \"body_excerpt\": \"aws_sesv2_domain_identity_feedback_attributes similar to Do the same but for Domain Identity It re-opens only introduces setting management for Email Identity but NOT for Domain Identity \\\\- * * No\",\n      \"state\": \"open\",\n      \"state_reason\": null,\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-02-26T15:30:50Z\",\n      \"score\": 0.174,\n      \"band\": \"weak\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"number\": 22924,\n      \"ref\": \"hashicorp/terraform-provider-aws#22924\",\n      \"title\": \"ses email identity recreated after being verified\",\n      \"body_excerpt\": \"I have created ses email identity through TF then verified it successfully. When I applied the same script for other changes, The email identity is created again and pending verification. resource \\\"aws_ses_email_identity\\\" \\\"ses_email\\\" { count = module.this.enabled ? 1 : 0 email = var.ses_email } So how to avoid recreating the email identity after being verified ? Terraform version is 1.0.10\",\n      \"state\": \"closed\",\n      \"state_reason\": \"completed\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2022-02-03T17:02:51Z\",\n      \"score\": 0.172,\n      \"band\": \"weak\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"corpus_size\": 11666,\n  \"thresholds\": {\n    \"likely\": 0.4,\n    \"possible\": 0.28\n  }\n}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0bbcd3aa-f8d6-47fc-8479-646105e31148","uuid":"3617ad2a-2ba1-474e-bc73-7a1fcee78c6c","timestamp":"2026-10-28T17:23:15.287Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"{\n  \"issue\": {\n    \"number\": 12,\n    \"title\": \"Support SES S/MIME signing with ACM certificates (`AssociateEmailIdentityCertificate` / `MessageSecurityOptions`)\",\n    \"author_association\": \"NONE\",\n    \"labels_at_open\": []\n  },\n  \"as_of\": \"2026-09-07T14:59:50+00:00\",\n  \"form\": {\n    \"template\": \"Request Net New Functionality\",\n    \"missing_required\": [],\n    \"empty_optional\": [],\n    \"used_form\": true\n  },\n  \"services\": {\n    \"resources_mentioned\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"aws_sesv2_email_identity_certificate\",\n        \"resource_e